  "implementation": [
    "CLI SessionShare owns isolated private temp directories, real gh auth/create subprocesses and Radius HTTP requests. Explicit gist bypasses Radius auth; forced Radius without a credential reports the source message; a handled Radius error never falls back.",
    "UserSettings loads and overlays sessionShareDestination; invalid values fall back to auto, including project overrides. Writer/selector persist auto/gist/radius and use the current effective setting for upload routing.",
    "Runtime SessionShareExport projects only the selected branch and rewrites parents sequentially before appending pi.share system/tool presentation. Gist HTML embeds Pi-compatible base64 viewer data with every branch and selected leaf.",
    "TerminalSessionShare uses existing concrete progress/editor owners, aborts on Escape/Ctrl+C without confirmation, terminates gist children, disposes progress and restores the editor. Provider credentials reuse the existing five-minute OAuth validity/refresh owner."
  ],
